 Tim> Starting next week (10/3 - 10/7) the OSL will be updating all of
 Tim> its Gentoo systems to baselayout-2. For those who don't know what
 Tim> baselayout is, it and openrc manage all the services on a Gentoo
 Tim> system. The update procedure will also include upgrading glibc and
 Tim> moving to modular, hardened kernels on managed machines.

 Tim> The update process will cause a temporary downtime due to
 Tim> rebooting, but this should only last a few minutes for most
 Tim> machines. We will be performing the update process mainly between
 Tim> 10:00-16:00 PST. Anyone that wishes to schedule a specific update
 Tim> time should contact us on IRC or respond to this email.

